      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a profound sense of obsolescence, and that feeling is incredibly heavy. Don't let the perceived shift of the world convince you that your worth is tied to a single industry or skill. Your life and your experience are valuable, even if the way you used to contribute has changed. Perhaps this is a moment to redefine what \"value\" means to you, shifting focus inward rather than trying to force yourself into a mold that no longer fits.",
